    },
    "body": "The shared Cue/Prefix construction improved factual probabilities but its endpoint corrected none. This adds a saved-data Rust diagnostic that replays the original 1,920 proposal records for the five actual factual prefixes, committing only original accepted edits and recomputing donor-specific Generate/U with every physical alias.\n\nThe independently audited path reaches a correct factual winner on row245 at proposal147 and loses it at proposal226; the other four never become correct on the accepted path. All561 full reductions and coefficient endpoints agree. No new gradient, encoder or autoregressive rollout, serving rule, or model export occurs. Complete sealed results are privately preserved and freshly verified; evidence and current-state record exact identities, costs and limitations.\n\nValidation: optimized pod build and five focused tests PASS at executed7672cc008; exact-head checks and final review will be posted before queue. Independent saved finite-algebra audit PASS160.237s; it does not readmit every intermediate state against all377 guards or reproduce encoders/backward. Next is unchanged89CE/377guard evaluation of the existing accepted crossing snapshot after actual delivery; a new complete reply remains unestablished.\n\nReferences #820\n",
